{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53392","headline":"奉送日本国使空海上人橘秀才朝献後却还 · 郑壬","name":"奉送日本国使空海上人橘秀才朝献後却还","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"承化来中国，朝天是外臣。\n异才谁作侣，孤屿自爲邻。\n鴈塔归殊域，鲸波涉巨津。\n他年续僧史，更载一贤人。\n（同前）（按：朱千乘等五人送空海归国诗五首，均录自张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑壬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}